From b5edc2d056bbe1c3bb2c7db4bbcf4a0d8ce2c923 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tinyu <tinyu0806@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 14:16:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add CoreMatrix PWM speaker support

Route Speaker tones through IOE GPIO11 PWM3 and control buzzer power through IOE GPIO2. Support timed tones, stop, volume, and playback state through the CoreMatrix tone backend.
